5:[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Définition et architecture des agents logiciels IA"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Un ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"agent logiciel IA"}]," (ou agent autonome) est un système informatique capable de percevoir son environnement, de raisonner sur ses objectifs et d'exécuter des actions de manière autonome pour atteindre ces objectifs, sans intervention humaine continue. Contrairement à un simple chatbot, un agent peut planifier des séquences d'actions, utiliser des outils externes (API, navigateur, code) et s'adapter à des situations imprévues."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Les architectures dominantes en 2026 :"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"ReAct"}]," (Reasoning + Acting) : alternance raisonnement / action, popularisé par les travaux de Yao et al. (2022)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Plan-and-Execute"}]," : planification explicite suivie d'exécution séquentielle"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Multi-agent"}]," : plusieurs agents spécialisés collaborent sous coordination d'un agent orchestrateur"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Agentic RAG"}]," : combinaison retrieval-augmented generation et capacités agentiques"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Marché mondial des agents IA : données 2026"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["| Indicateur | Valeur | Source |\n|-----------|--------|--------|\n| Taille du marché agents IA (mondial) | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"13,8 milliards USD"}]," | Grand View Research, 2025 |\n| CAGR prévu 2026-2031 | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"44,7 %"}]," | MarketsandMarkets, 2025 |\n| Taille projetée 2031 | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"86,4 milliards USD"}]," | Grand View Research, 2025 |\n| Part de marché Europe | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"22 %"}]," | IDC, 2026 |\n| Nombre d'entreprises proposant des agents IA | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"+3 200"}]," (startups incluses) | Crunchbase, 2026 |\n| Investissements VC en agents IA (2025) | ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"4,1 milliards USD"}]," | PitchBook, 2025 |"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Adoption par secteur en France et Europe"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"| Secteur | Taux d'adoption agents IA | Cas d'usage principaux |\n|---------|--------------------------|----------------------|\n| Finance / Assurance | 61 % | Analyse risque, conformité automatisée, KYC |\n| E-commerce / Retail | 54 % | Service client 24/7, recommandations, gestion stocks |\n| Santé | 43 % | Aide au diagnostic, triage, gestion RDV |\n| RH / Recrutement | 58 % | Screening CV, sourcing candidats, onboarding |\n| Marketing | 67 % | Personnalisation contenu, SEO, campagnes |\n| Service client | 71 % | Résolution tickets, escalade intelligente |\n| Développement logiciel | 78 % | Génération code, review, débogage |"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Source : Gartner \"Hype Cycle for AI 2025\" + enquête terrain Agents-IA.pro (n=340 décideurs)."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frameworks et outils leaders en 2026"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Frameworks open source"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"LangChain"}]," : 95 000 étoiles GitHub, standard de facto pour chaînes d'agents"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"AutoGen"}]," (Microsoft) : multi-agent conversationnel, optimisé entreprise"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"CrewAI"}]," : orchestration rôles spécialisés, très adopté en PME"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"LlamaIndex"}]," : spécialisé RAG agentic, fort en récupération documentaire"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Plateformes no-code / low-code"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"n8n"}]," : 48 000 étoiles GitHub, 400+ intégrations, auto-hébergeable"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Make (Integromat)"}]," : 200+ millions d'opérations/mois, standard ETL IA"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zapier AI"}]," : 6 000+ apps connectées, adoption massive TPE/PME"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"APIs et modèles sous-jacents"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"OpenAI Assistants API"}]," : tool use, file search, code interpreter intégrés"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Anthropic Claude API"}]," : contexte 200K tokens, tool use avancé"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Google Gemini 2.0"}]," : multimodal natif, grounding web en temps réel"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Performance et benchmarks"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Les agents IA modernes (2025-2026) atteignent des scores significatifs sur les benchmarks standards :"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"SWE-bench"}]," (résolution bugs logiciels) : meilleurs agents à ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"49 % de résolution"}]," vs 1,96 % en 2023"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"GAIA"}]," (tâches monde réel) : 72 % de succès pour les meilleurs systèmes multi-agents"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"WebArena"}]," (navigation web autonome) : 45 % de tâches réussies (Claude 3.5 + outils)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"HumanEval"}]," (génération de code) : 96,3 % (GPT-4o avec agent code)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Défis et limites actuels"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Hallucinations et fiabilité"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Les agents commettent encore des erreurs factuelles. Les architectures avec vérification (fact-checking agent, validation humaine sur décisions critiques) réduisent le taux d'erreur à moins de 3 % sur des tâches structurées."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Sécurité et prompt injection"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Les agents multi-étapes sont vulnérables aux attaques par injection de prompts via des données externes (pages web, documents). Les frameworks de sandboxing (E2B, Daytona) et les garde-fous LLM (Llama Guard, Perspective API) adressent partiellement ce risque."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Coûts opérationnels"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Un agent complexe sur une tâche de 30 minutes consomme entre 0,05 $ et 2,50 $ en tokens LLM selon le modèle. L'optimisation (caching, modèles plus légers pour sous-tâches, RAG) réduit les coûts de 60 à 80 %."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Perspectives 2027"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Selon Gartner, d'ici fin 2027 :"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"25 % des entreprises du Fortune 500"}]," auront des agents IA opérationnels dans au moins 3 processus métiers"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Les agents remplaceront ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"15 % des tâches aujourd'hui externalisées"}]," vers les centres d'appels offshore"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["L'émergence des ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"\"agent networks\""}]," (marchés d'agents spécialisés inter-opérables) constituera le prochain paradigme après les LLM"]}],"\n"]}]]
